upload backend   curl -F "file=@small.pdf" /api/uploads → 200 · doc created
                 curl -F "file=@huge.pdf"  /api/uploads → 413 · clean error message
                 curl -F "file=@batch.zip" /api/uploads → 200 · N docs created · shared batch_id
