                 curl -F "file=@empty.txt"  /api/uploads → 415 (text/plain rejected at public endpoint)
                 internal endpoint /api/_internal/uploads still accepts text (used by seed)

upload-back loop GET /api/demo/atelier-nova/archive.zip → 200 · application/zip · 18 PDFs inside ·
                   total uncompressed ≤ 10 MB
                 manual: download from /about CTA · upload via /app/inbox drop zone · watch the
                 18 docs land · all process to status="done" within 2 minutes · all 6 categories
                 represented in the resulting list view

embedded viewer  /app/inbox detail panel for any PDF-backed doc renders an embedded view of the
                 original PDF · fallback "Open PDF" link works in browsers that block <object>
                 dev_source text-only docs show only the AI-extraction view (no PDF tab)
                 source pills in /app/ask are clickable → navigate to /app/inbox?focus=<id> →
                 inbox opens that doc's detail

review states    PATCH /api/documents/{id}/review_state with each of approved/rejected/needs_review
                   → 200 · column updated · AuditEvent appended with old→new transition
                 UI: three buttons in detail panel · current state shown as a small badge in list view
                 default state on new uploads: "pending"

site IA (RO)     visit / → Romanian homepage · hero present · CTA chain to /demo
                 visit /about → Romanian About page · 4-section structure:
                   cine suntem · pentru cine · ce face · ce NU face
                   includes synthetic-data disclosure · links to GitHub repo
                 visit /demo → Romanian walk-through · two CTAs visible:
                   "Descarcă arhiva demo" → archive.zip · "Deschide aplicația" → /app/inbox
                 public nav links: Acasă · Despre · Demo · Aplicație (last one → /app/inbox)
                 /app/* nav and copy unchanged (English) · no language switcher on public site

tone check       no instances of "revolutionary" "transform" "next-generation" "empower" "AI-powered
                 innovation" in any Romanian or English copy added this slice ·
                 read the RO copy aloud · should sound like a thoughtful colleague, not a brochure

evals            uv run python -m app.evals.run
                   → slice-3/4/5 fixtures all pass at previous thresholds (regression check) ·
                     contract_reviewer 10/10 · ask_questions ≥80% citation correctness ·
                     draft_reply 7+ · invoice_extractor intentional-fail still fails
                   → new fixture set added for at least 3 of the 18 Atelier Nova PDFs:
                     1 supplier_invoice (extraction accuracy) · 1 contract (review terms) ·
