## Resolved decisions (coordinator)

```
public site language        Romanian for /, /about, /demo · /app/* stays English
                            (rules.constraints amended 2026-05-11 · carve-out for RO SME audience)

upload-back loop shape      single ZIP download of all 18 PDFs · visitor re-uploads to /app/inbox
                            (rejected: pre-seeded inbox · per-doc Try-this buttons · auth-gated download)
                            rationale: dogfoods the upload path · shows "AI prepares" in motion

slice size                  single builder session · all 7 buckets in one slice
                            (rejected: 7a/7b split · adds coordinator overhead for limited risk reduction)

PDF authoring               weasyprint + Jinja2 (Bar B, settled 2026-05-10)
                            ~5-7 visual templates · letterhead via typography · no raster logos

demo content storage        YAML definitions committed · generated PDFs gitignored ·
                            regenerated by `python scripts/generate_demo_pdfs.py`
                            archive ZIP served via /api/demo/atelier-nova/archive.zip
                            (rejected: commit binary PDFs · noisy diffs on regeneration)

dev_source reclassification existing 8 docs marked source="dev_source" · filtered from default
                            /app/inbox view · still seeded under --include-dev-source flag ·
                            still used by eval harness (regression fixtures preserved)

needs-review action         third review state alongside approved/rejected · new column
                            review_state on Document · audit event on each transition

text upload                 dropped from public /api/uploads · moved to /api/_internal/uploads
                            behind ENABLE_INTERNAL_TEXT_UPLOAD env flag (default true in dev,
                            false in any production-style env) · used by seed + eval only

PDF size caps               5 MB per PDF · 10 MB per ZIP · 20 PDFs per ZIP
                            (matches the 2026-05-10 demo polish decision)

site nav (public)           Acasă · Despre · Demo · Aplicație
                            "Aplicație" links to /app/inbox · no auth gate in MVP

About page structure        cine suntem · pentru cine · ce face · ce NU face
                            includes synthetic-data disclosure (companies.synthetic) +
                            GitHub link · sets expectations honestly

filler docs (3 of 18)       1 supplier_offer + 1 client_request + 1 accountant_request
                            builder authors content · uses existing identities where possible ·
                            if a new identity is needed: add to companies.synthetic FIRST
```

