## Schema additions

```
Document.source             ENUM("public", "dev_source") NULL DEFAULT "public"
Document.review_state       ENUM("pending", "approved", "rejected", "needs_review") NULL
                            DEFAULT "pending"
Document.review_note        TEXT NULL
Document.batch_id           UUID NULL (set when uploaded as part of a ZIP batch)
Document.pdf_path           TEXT NULL (filesystem path to stored PDF bytes ·
                            populated on PDF upload · null for legacy text-only docs)

new audit event types       review_state_changed:<old>→<new>
                            upload_zip_batch:<batch_id>:<count>
                            pdf_too_large · zip_too_large · zip_too_many_pdfs (rejections)
```

Alembic migration: `slice-7 dev_source · review_state · batch_id · pdf_path`.

