```text
Read in order: CLAUDE.md · ops/project.state.hybrid · ops/rules.constraints.hybrid (esp. amended Language section) · ops/companies.synthetic.hybrid · ops/slice-7.novai-desk-inbox-demo.hybrid · codocz/romanian_sme_ai_companion_promotion_go_to_market_pack.md §4 §5 (tone guardrails).

