4. GENERATOR + SEED INTEGRATION.
   - apps/api/scripts/generate_demo_pdfs.py: read all YAMLs in demo_content/atelier_nova/ · resolve short-ids against ops/companies.synthetic.hybrid (parse the file or hardcode a small companies.py registry — pick the simpler one and commit the choice) · render PDF for each · write to apps/api/var/demo_pdfs/atelier_nova/<filename> · print summary table
