   Commit: "slice-7(seed): generator + seed_demo extension · 18 Atelier Nova PDFs seeded clean"

5. PDF + ZIP UPLOAD BACKEND.
   - apps/api/app/services/upload_intake.py: pure functions
       validate_pdf(file_bytes, filename) → raises HTTPException on size > 5MB or invalid PDF magic
       extract_zip(zip_bytes) → list of (filename, pdf_bytes) · raises on size > 10MB · raises on >20 PDFs · raises on any inner PDF > 5MB · raises on non-PDF inner files
       persist_pdf(doc_id, pdf_bytes) → writes to app/storage/<doc_id>.pdf · returns path
       ingest_pdf(filename, pdf_bytes, source="public", batch_id=None) → creates Document · persists bytes · runs pdfplumber for raw_text · enqueues analysis (existing BackgroundTask path) · returns Document
   - apps/api/app/api/uploads.py: refactor POST /api/uploads
       accept content-type application/pdf OR application/zip (reject text/plain · reject others with 415)
       PDF path: validate_pdf → ingest_pdf → 200 {document_id, status}
       ZIP path: extract_zip → batch_id = uuid4() · for each inner PDF: ingest_pdf(..., batch_id=batch_id) → 200 {batch_id, documents: [...]}
   - apps/api/app/api/_internal/uploads.py: NEW · accepts text/plain · only mounted if env ENABLE_INTERNAL_TEXT_UPLOAD == "true"
   - Update main.py routing accordingly
   - Verify with curl all 5 acceptance cases in §Acceptance > upload backend
   Commit: "slice-7(uploads): PDF+ZIP intake with size/count caps · text moved to internal endpoint"

6. PDF SERVING + EMBEDDED VIEWER.
   - apps/api/app/api/documents.py: GET /api/documents/{id}/pdf → 200 application/pdf with stored bytes · 404 if no pdf_path · 410 if file missing on disk (with clear error)
   - apps/web/src/lib/components/PdfViewer.svelte: <object data={pdfUrl} type="application/pdf"> with fallback <a href={pdfUrl} target="_blank">Open PDF</a> for browsers that block inline · accept pdfUrl prop · small loading state
   - /app/inbox detail view: when document.pdf_path is set, show "Source PDF" tab/panel alongside the AI-extraction view · use PdfViewer component · for source="dev_source" docs (no pdf_path), hide the tab and only show extraction view
